{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhead corner barrage play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/2e6df0ce39b05caf9a59f202977233b9.avif?t=1770295224\" width=352 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedigree matching:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/0f72cfd7a6c483871d71b7c80f07af0a.avif?t=1770295224\" width=324 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can build their own BD by matching different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Magical chemical reactions can occur between different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the same bloodline can trigger the ultimate evolution of a pure blood bloodline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different lineages can also induce the mutation and evolution of lineages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 All skills can be inserted into the chip to change their skill form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Skill trajectories, attributes, and ballistic attributes can be freely matched</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565290?t=1770295224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/b2df0259caf17c1834414caae55e61800f64b845/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770295224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/f2a7c063ad7997b5ff0013ee2a4843d1c86ef4bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770295224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/f2a7c063ad7997b5ff0013ee2a4843d1c86ef4bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770295224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhead corner barrage play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/2e6df0ce39b05caf9a59f202977233b9.avif?t=1770295224\" width=352 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedigree matching:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/0f72cfd7a6c483871d71b7c80f07af0a.avif?t=1770295224\" width=324 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can build their own BD by matching different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Magical chemical reactions can occur between different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the same bloodline can trigger the ultimate evolution of a pure blood bloodline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different lineages can also induce the mutation and evolution of lineages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 All skills can be inserted into the chip to change their skill form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Skill trajectories, attributes, and ballistic attributes can be freely matched</p>","developers":["ZodiacStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/576f88f2a5e6798a9b3a27b95ea40e38d862bfc7/header.jpg?t=1770295224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565290/1987721276/b62e7945c